==Description==
'''v1.69.0''' is the one hundred and twenty-first update to be released in Tower Defense Simulator, on the 2nd of July 2025. It added the {{Color|EventMission|Base 1776}} [[Military Base]] skin and brought back the [[Firework Technician]].

This update encompassed five versions, the main v1.69.0 (released 2 July 2025) and four minor updaptes, the minor v1.69.1 (released 2 July 2025), minor v1.69.2 (released 3 July 2025), v1.69.2a (released 4 July 2025) and v1.69.2b (released 6 July 2025).

==Additions==
*''🇺🇸 Rise for the Pledge!'' [[Mission Quests|Mission Quest]]
*''🦅 Eagle Screech'' [[Mission Quests|Mission Quest]]
*{{Color|EventMission|Base 1776}} [[Military Base]]
*[[The Hatch Event]]

==Changes & Bugfixes==
*Info button previously only present on towers with double paths is now present at all times.
**It showcases information on how the tower functions, alongside basic statistics and its various attributes like detections.
**Fixed the button not working.
**Fixed the button not appearing on vertical upgrade menus.
*Added tower descriptions when hovering on a tower in the hotbar.
*Updated the skin selection menu to allow for more space with the information about the skin creators.
*Wave counter UI no longer overlaps with the base health bar.
*Fixed {{Robux|Robux}} crates in the [[Daily Store]] being purchasable in geo-restricted areas.
*[[Nuclear Monster]] and [[Minigunner (Pizza Party)|Minigunner]] no longer get stuck after using their abilities.
*Replaying the [[Tutorial]] can no longer give the player the rewards again if they are still in the lobby [[Tutorial]].
*Miscellaneous fixes for the [[Mission Quests]] being impossible to complete.
*Fixed legacy [[Explosive Ducky (D00M's Revenge)|Explosive Ducky]] using the icon of its modern version.

:In '''v1.69.1''':
*Version number changed from ''v1.69.0'' to ''v1.69.1''.

:In '''v1.69.2''':
*Fixed {{Color|EventMission|Base 1776}} [[Humvee 3]] being possible to collide with.

:In '''v1.69.2a''':
*[[Fireworks]] modifier is now active on all maps.

:In '''v1.69.2b''':
*[[Fireworks]] modifier disabled.

